      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rushcutters_Bay",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The area was first called \"Rush Cutting Bay\" because early settlers harvested tall rushes for thatching.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
